(1)   19/   6F330 :                     ; Macros
(1)   20/   6F330 :                     ; turn a sample rate into a djnz loop counter
(1)   21/   6F330 :                     pcmLoopCounterBase function sampleRate,baseCycles, 1+(Z80_Clock/(sampleRate)-(baseCycles)+(13/2))/13
(1)   22/   6F330 :                     pcmLoopCounter function sampleRate, pcmLoopCounterBase(sampleRate,90) ; 90 is the number of cycles zPlaySEGAPCMLoop takes to deliver one sample.
(1)   23/   6F330 :                     dpcmLoopCounter function sampleRate, pcmLoopCounterBase(sampleRate,301/2) ; 301 is the number of cycles zPlayPCMLoop takes to deliver two samples.
