(1)  102/   6F488 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
(1)  103/   6F488 :                     ; Priority of sound. New music or SFX must have a priority higher than or equal
(1)  104/   6F488 :                     ; to what is stored in v_sndprio or it won't play. If bit 7 of new priority is
(1)  105/   6F488 :                     ; set ($80 and up), the new music or SFX will not set its priority -- meaning
(1)  106/   6F488 :                     ; any music or SFX can override it (as long as it can override whatever was
(1)  107/   6F488 :                     ; playing before). Usually, SFX will only override SFX, special SFX ($D0-$DF)
(1)  108/   6F488 :                     ; will only override special SFX and music will only override music.
(1)  109/   6F488 :                     ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
